      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you rename BpfCoordinator#tetherOffloadRuleUpdate, suggest renaming this method so it has the same name as that one.\n\nActually, maybe you can remove this method entirely? The only thing it does before calling into BpfCoordinator#tetherOffloadRuleUpdate is to return early if mUsingBpfOffload is false. But BpfCoordinator#tetherOffloadRuleUpdate also immediately returns early if isUsingBpf is false. Isn\u0027t that the same?\n\nIf you can remove it entirely, probably best to do it in a separate CL before this one.",
